* Celda de op-amp conductual SUAVE (sin conmutadores; converge rapido en transitorio).
*  Etapa 1: gm con saturacion tanh (fija el slew rate), integrador R1||C1 con
*  recorte por diodos ideales (evita windup), salida limitada a rieles - VRAIL, Rout 50.
*  Aol = GM*R1 ; GBW = GM/(2*pi*C1) ; SR = IMAX/C1
.subckt OPAX INP INN VP VN OUT params: GBW=1Meg AOL=398k SR=0.6Meg VRAIL=25m VOS=0 CIN=6p
.param GM=1m R1={AOL/GM} C1={GM/(2*pi*GBW)} IMAX={SR*C1}
Ccm1 INP VN {CIN}
Ccm2 INN VN {CIN}
Rid INP INN 10T
B1 0 N1 I={IMAX}*tanh(({GM}/{IMAX})*(V(INP,INN)+{VOS}))
R1 N1 0 {R1}
C1 N1 0 {C1}
BCP CP 0 V=(V(VP)-V(VN))/2
BCN CN 0 V=-(V(VP)-V(VN))/2
DCP N1 CP DCL
DCN CN N1 DCL
B2 OI 0 V=limit((V(VP)+V(VN))/2+V(N1), V(VN)+{VRAIL}, V(VP)-{VRAIL})
RO OI OUT 50
.model DCL D(Ron=10 Roff=1T Vfwd=0.01)
.ends OPAX

* OPA = ST TS922 (rail-to-rail entrada/salida, 2.7-12 V): GBW 4 MHz, SR 1 V/us, Aol ~106 dB,
*  salida a ~30 mV de los rieles, ruido 9 nV/rtHz. Vos por parametro (tipico 0.9 mV).
.subckt OPA INP INN VP VN OUT params: VOS=0
X1 INP INN VP VN OUT OPAX GBW=4Meg AOL=200k SR=1Meg VRAIL=30m VOS={VOS} CIN=3p
.ends OPA
